---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const tools=[['sizing','Generator load planner','Compare all-load, essential-load and one-managed-load-at-a-time scenarios using your own equipment data.'],['fuel','Natural gas vs. propane','Use exact published consumption points or a documented custom input. Compare outage fuel costs and stored inventory.'],['quotes','Three-quote comparison','Record three scopes, identify missing items and add documented adjustments. Save privately in this browser or print.'],['ownership','Ownership cost planner','Build nominal 5-, 10- and 15-year budgets from your actual quote and explicit assumptions.']];
---
<BaseLayout title="Home Generator Planning Tools" description="Four transparent homeowner tools for generator loads, natural gas vs propane, three installer quotes and long-term ownership costs."><div class="editorial-container publication-section"><p class="eyebrow">THE HOMEOWNER’S PLANNING DESK</p><h1>Turn research into a purchase plan.</h1><p class="lede">Bring clearer questions and documented assumptions to your installer. These tools support planning; they do not approve sizing, installation or code compliance.</p><div class="tool-directory">{tools.map(([path,title,description])=><article><h2><a href={`/planning/${path}/`}>{title} →</a></h2><p>{description}</p></article>)}</div><p>Technical professional review pending. Tools run in your browser. Saving is optional; no plan is submitted to us.</p></div></BaseLayout>
